    "heading": "Level 5: Sorcerous Restoration",
    "lineStart": 4019,
    "lineEnd": 4021
  },
  "section": "3.262",
  "rulesText": "When you finish a Short Rest, you can regain expended Sorcery Points, but no more than a number equal to half your Sorcerer level (round down). Once you use this feature, you can't do so again until you finish a Long Rest."
}
